<title>UK: Autronica to supply Norway tanker sensors.</title>
<headline>Autronica to supply Norway tanker sensors.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Autronica AS, the Norwegian unit of Britain's Whessoe Plc, said on Tuesday it had won an order worth about 1.5 million stg to supply cargo monitoring instrumentation for two large chemical tankers to be built by Kvaerner ASA for shipowners Storli.</p>
<p>&quot;This order is confirmation of Autronica's strong presence and capability in the market, and is particularly significant in that it incorporates the first of a number of new products which the company will introduce throughout the year,&quot; a statement quoted Whessoe chief executive Chris Fleetwood as saying.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
